{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2023-03", "window": 1, "start_date": 1677628800, "end_date": 1680307199, "month_true_total": 12, "quota": 12, "returned": 12, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:53:58 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "135711423", "author": {"steamid": "76561198105684673", "personaname": "richluvsbama", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198105684673/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 2601, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2601, "last_played": 1679163368, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Played on Steam. Great finale to perhaps the greatest series of my gaming life.", "timestamp_created": 1680136895, "timestamp_updated": 1680136895, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "135560930", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045282909", "personaname": "A1 Steaksauce", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198045282909/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 12365, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7384, "last_played": 1772572267, "avatar": "2f0ad158d25a7c81d8d2d2a965745a0a4f63415c"}, "language": "english", "review": "I got this to play the multiplayer with friends and it's still as great as ever. Some of the controls are fairly un-intuitive, though, mostly just the interact/use key being the same as the sprint and revive keys. This is an old gen port to PC and is barely supported anymore by EA; it has to run through the ♥♥♥♥♥♥ EA App and even then it's not guaranteed to work for everyone. They don't give two ♥♥♥♥♥ about the multiplayer community, and it's a shame, too. Legendary Edition not having the multiplayer is just criminal. Also, there's no controller support. Would not recommend buying if you only want to play the story. Just get Legendary Edition for that, you're otherwise missing out on loads of content, anyway.\n\nPlenty of people still play MP and it really is some of the best co-op you can find despite a little jank to the controls.", "timestamp_created": 1679942261, "timestamp_updated": 1682738802, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.624558925628662109", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "135407890", "author": {"steamid": "76561198064568395", "personaname": "GameZard", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gamezard/", "num_games_owned": 11558, "num_reviews": 1112, "playtime_forever": 109, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 109, "last_played": 1679681220, "avatar": "241713c06bd7bdc6d5fd758d932665902c185017"}, "language": "english", "review": "[table]    [tr]        [th][h1] My Playthrough [/h1][/th]        [th][url=https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLTZKn1hLlcQPNE6-CIhY68HRcvjxSswAK] Youtube Playlist [/url][/th]    [/tr]    [tr]        [td][h1]The Review[/h1][/td]        [td]This game makes me very sad. Mass Effect was a great Scifi RPG and while Mass Effect 2 was not as great as ME1 it was still good but this game is just awful. This game take all the flaws of Mass Effect 2 and make them worse. The game is now no longer feels as open as Mass Effect 1. It takes the linear feel of ME2 to an extreme. There is only one explorable area and that is the main hub. The graphics and effects got worse than ME2. Their is little to no RPG mechanics left. They added a very poorly implemented multiplayer mode, which this game didn't need in the first place. But the worse aspect of this game is the story. The plot of this game is so badly written and full of plot holes that it makes the game look like a parody of Mass Effect. They wanted to end this series so much that they try so hard to desperately wrap up all the plot threads and it really shows with the crappy endings. I can't recommend this game, even if you are a Mass Effect fan you will be majorly disappointed.[/td]    [/tr][/table]", "timestamp_created": 1679763763, "timestamp_updated": 1679763763, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.289944916963577271", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "135335587", "author": {"steamid": "76561199201987079", "personaname": "i_am_twisti", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/i_am_twisti/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 815, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 481, "last_played": 1695326267, "avatar": "7ae537b6b7b7b09e68f52e76cdb8f0727f5cb270"}, "language": "english", "review": "exciting and good story line", "timestamp_created": 1679689513, "timestamp_updated": 1679689513, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "135243740", "author": {"steamid": "76561199222955731", "personaname": "SirJMorgado", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SirJMorgado/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2026, "playtime_last_two_