er generic human enemy ? Why did they make Miranda (the hotest and probably the only character I truly cared about) a side character. And also why she Isnt on the Normandy alongside everyone else. Also where the hell Is Jacob ? One of the biggest story pilars of Mass Effect 2 was Miranda. She should be with the squad. I dont like the 6 month time jump betwen 2 and 3. Oh now suddenly It took the reapers 6 months to reach earth. What the hell Bioware. \n\nThe graphics are awesome and the soundtrack. But what Is this story...", "timestamp_created": 1679049275, "timestamp_updated": 1679049275, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476463824510574341", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "134669959", "author": {"steamid": "76561198150726022", "personaname": "Cpt. Victor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/legocrazz/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 116, "playtime_forever": 13, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9, "last_played": 1678829912, "avatar": "cff0367a84bae43c412c36ba66c7f5e0a7addd71"}, "language": "english", "review": "so far pretty ♥♥♥♥ due to the ea app immediately breaking when i purchased it and zero response on any channel when trying to get the online pass error fixed.\n\nedit. should just be delisted. ea is indenial about the errors with the online and every outlet to contact ea support will either net no response or if you do get one youll be redirected to contact steam. this is a blatant scam and im amazed its still listed.", "timestamp_created": 1678827760, "timestamp_updated": 1678830383, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.514278113842010498", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "134636972", "author": {"steamid": "76561199271579151", "personaname": "GoatSabir", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199271579151/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 1972, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 561, "last_played": 1780316847, "avatar": "1c0b5c37a442a2d39f32902ec42f2e26ba6a142e"}, "language": "english", "review": "With the money it costs to have DLC\"S packs in Mass Effect 3, you could honestly combine both the game and DLC, this would make you have enough cash for the Legendary Edition. On top of that you have baby reaper EA app that tries to indoctrinate all users to use which doesn't work offline or if your in-game and suddenly lose internet connection all DlC's will randomly not appear. Is the game good, yes its god-tier but with baby reaper EA app, I can foresee a lot of uninstalling and re-installing", "timestamp_created": 1678777453, "timestamp_updated": 1678777453, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "134537812", "author": {"steamid": "76561199228948682", "personaname": "Alex Ven Helsing", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199228948682/", "num_games_owned": 566, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1738, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1736, "last_played": 1678924582, "avatar": "d068a412598756f2e338cb17b89835b8e9c8f4a6"}, "language": "english", "review": "قوية دي\n", "timestamp_created": 1678626297, "timestamp_updated": 1678626297, "voted_up": true, 